{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0493_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2c4242c4535fdce74d9256af9b66fb9d4fe99cc53734e08403ee6936f8e5f3b3", "ja": "へぇ、ロコの手作りか。そういえば、\n駄菓子屋のロケの時、ずいぶん熱中してたもんな。", "zh": "哦，是ROCO亲手做的啊。说起来，去粗点心店取景的时候，你可是相当投入呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0493_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "1cb6e4ad2722c9118e61b92f4343f905a52e95e399513dfb08f11eb29609cb2d", "ja": "まさに、それがきっかけです！　ルールも\nシンプルで、誰でもエンジョイできますし……。", "zh": "没错，就是那个契机！规则既\n简单，谁都能乐在其中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0493_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "d9c38ed66d6c191628b3c06a9514cabcb35ccb83a758bcb92859501a5f24ce9f", "ja": "オンリーワンをデザインできるのもグッドです！\nすっかりロコのフェイバリットゲームになりました♪", "zh": "还能设计出独一无二的作品，真棒！\n已经完全成了我最喜欢的ROCO游戏♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
